6QzUCUW3KMQ7kNvwG5PjQ1&_nc_oc=AdoqSECdl5cRDU2d-A9cX6IeiwKETo6aAzaLIVEGnNpIeVU8DHI6O-k9V8vZcb93JCY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0Upz17TuUANyJr8UAoom0Ctno-_Wb_CgOb-oMthsUItA&oe=69D8F810"}, {"file_name": "screens.png", "id": "771101150621784", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569471_771101160621783_7591652676362700724_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y-RwaHHrSs8Q7kNvwEyM95b&_nc_oc=AdpwE9SPKQqMEraY3ssmZpcZwr0roMUpQe1OAGitu5dJrCNQtDjW-QJaYAlPoeWk5x0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2kstX1q1NRW-Iw85AsLlshGq-XhhtVxCaIdcW_9zJreg&oe=69D8E160"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Outcasts of Dungeon Magic World Rogue Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Being in the role of a brave wanderer, help dwarfs to defend their kingdom fortress from a rampaging mob of beastly invaders. Captured dwarfs need help, and they have something to offer you as a reward.\nBattle enemies through a story-based campaign across dungeon and evolve your combat skills to achieve better results.\nFeatures:\n- Procedurally generated dungeons \u2013 Twisting passages, long halls and wide-open chambers all need a hero to clear them.\n- Story-based Campaign \u2013 Fend off monsters across acts to discover the mysterious power behind their relentless assaults.\n- Companion System - Free and protect allies from captivity and use their combat power to your advantage.\n- 9 Different Enemies \u2013 Including scavengers, ghouls and a whole bunch of ugly orcs.", "short_description": "It is a third person fantasy action game, where in the role of a brave wanderer, help dwarfs to defend their kingdom fortress from a rampaging mob of beastly invaders."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midnight.works/vr/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://midnight.works/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Midnight G